            "review_text": "fionakyrkou\nMelbourne, Australia118 contributions\n0\n5⭐️ dinner, delicious\nApr 2025 • Couples\nBit of a wait to get a table but well worth waiting for this amazing dish. A very small restauraunt, seats 38 people and the turn over is fast. Basically eat, pay and run. 😁 No pre booking so you have no choice but to line up.\nFantastic flavours, hot and overall delicious.\nService was extremely prompt, dishes came in minutes. \nHighly recommend this 5⭐️ dinner.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nExpect a short wait to get a table. Turn over is very fast so the wait isn't too bad. You must bring CASH. NO CARDS accepted\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 8, 2025",
